Directory Explanations/app: The core of the application.layout.tsx: The root layout. This now contains the IntakeProvider to make the context available to the entire app.page.tsx: The main "page" of the app. This component holds the routing logic (the switch statement) that renders the different "page" components.globals.css: Where the Tailwind directives (@tailwind base, etc.) live./app/components: All React components./pages: These are the individual "pages" or "screens" of our app (e.g., LandingPage, DashboardPage). They are imported by the root app/page.tsx./ui: These are the mock shadcn/ui components (Button, Card, etc.), separated into their own files.icons.tsx: All the inlined Lucide SVG icons are exported from this one file.ai-helper.tsx: The new component that contains the Gemini API logic and UI for the "AI Meal Helper" button, keeping the DashboardPage cleaner./app/context: Holds all React Context providers.IntakeContext.tsx: Manages the state for the multi-step intake form and persists it to localStorage./app/lib: Contains helper files, types, and constants.utils.ts: Contains the cn utility for merging Tailwind classes.types.ts: Contains all TypeScript interfaces for our data (e.g., IntakeData, AiPlan).constants.ts: All static constants (e.g., PAGES, DIET_TYPES)./app/services: For all external data fetching.gemini.ts: Contains the fetchWithRetry function for calling the Gemini API.mockAi.ts: Contains the mock AI service (fetchAiPlan) and the MOCK_AI_PLAN data.Root Files:package.json: Manages all project dependencies and scripts.tailwind.config.ts: Configuration for Tailwind CSS.tsconfig.json: TypeScript configuration, including path aliases (@/*).
